# Sync experiment documentation

When you change experiment config or commit new baselines, **update experimentDocs in the same task**.

## Doc split

| File | Contents |
|------|----------|
| **`experimentDocs/EXPERIMENTS.md`** | Gemini API tests — real MSAs, task outcomes, real-world examples |
| **`experimentDocs/FINDINGS.md`** | Interpretation of Gemini results |

## Triggers

- `benchmark/run_experiment.py`, `benchmark/live_providers.py`, `benchmark/experiment.py` → update **EXPERIMENTS.md**, FINDINGS.md
- Committed `experiments/live_gemini/results.json` → update EXPERIMENTS.md + FINDINGS if interpretation changes

## Checklist

1. `experimentDocs/EXPERIMENTS.md` — Gemini runs, real-life scenarios, per-task outcomes
2. `experimentDocs/FINDINGS.md` — interpretation
3. `README.md` — setup and quick reference
4. `context/STORE.md` — status + decisions log
5. Bump `Last synced` date in EXPERIMENTS.md

## Verification

```powershell
python scripts/sync_experiment_docs.py --check
python -m pytest tests/ -q
```

Do not paste API keys into committed files.
